# UI Copy

- All user-facing text is in French (the app's language): page titles, menu
  items, labels, buttons, placeholders, helper texts, toasts, empty states and
  error messages. Never generate English user-facing copy.
- Use direct, consistent vocabulary adapted to the user's level.
- Describe errors with the cause and the possible action to resolve them.
- Give empty states a short explanation and a useful next action.
- Prefer precise action labels over generic wording.

